This identity allows us to rewrite the cost functional purely in terms of the induced measure $\mathbb{Q}^\theta$, and the control problem becomes
\begin{equation}
    \label{eq:variational}
    \mathcal{V}_\eps = \inf_{\theta \in \Theta} \left\{ G(\mathcal{L}(X_1^{\mathbb{Q}^\theta})) + \eps \mathcal{H}(\mathbb{Q}^\theta | \mathbb{P}) \right\}.
\end{equation}
